  "solution": "1. ÷, +, −, ×, =\n\n__**150 ÷ 3**__ + 10 - __**2 × 7**__ = 46\n\n⇒ __**50 +**____** 10**__ - 14 = 46\n\n⇒ __**60**____** - 14**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 46 = 46\n\n2. −, ×, +, ÷, =\n\n150 - __**3 × 10**__ + __**2 ÷ 7**__ = 46\n\n⇒ __**150**__ - 30 __**+**____** 0.28**__ = 46\n\n⇒ __**150.28 -**____** 3**____**0**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 120.28 ≠ 46\n\n3. +, −, ÷, ×, =\n\n150 + 3 - __**10 ÷ 2**__ × 7 = 46\n\n⇒ 150 + 3 - __**5 ×**____** 7**__ = 46\n\n⇒ __**150 + 3**__ - 35 = 46\n\n⇒ __**153 - 35**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 118 ≠ 46\n\n4. ×, +, ÷, −, =\n\n__**150 × 3**__ + __**10 ÷ 2**__ - 7 = 46\n\n⇒ __**450 + 5**__ - 7 = 46\n\n⇒ __**455 - 7**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 448 ≠ 46\n\nHence, '**÷, +, −, ×, =**' is the correct answer.",
